{"id":"word:hebrew:H6212","type":"word","title":"עֶשֶׂב","subtitle":"H6212 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"grass (or any tender shoot)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to עֶשֶׂב (H6212) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 33 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"עֶשֶׂב (ʻeseb) means grass (or any tender shoot) First listed occurrence: 2Kgs 19 26."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"עֶשֶׂב","transliteration":"ʻeseb","pronunciation":"eh'seb","strong":"H6212","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6212","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["עֵ֣שֶׂב","עֵ֥שֶׂב","עֵ֤שֶׂב","עֵֽשֶׂב","עֵ֑שֶׂב"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",15],["HNcmsc",9],["HR/Ncmsc",2],["HRd/Ncmsa",2],["HC/R/Ncmsc",1],["HNcmsc/Sp3mp",1],["HC/Ncmsc",1],["HNcmpc",1],["HC/Ncmsa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"grass (or any tender shoot)","usage":"grass, herb.","full":"H6212. eseb עֵ֫שֶׂב noun masculine Gen 1:11 herb, herbage ; — ׳ע absolute Deut 11:15 +; construct Gen 2:5 +; suffix עֶשְׂבָּם Isa 42:15 ; plural construct עִשְּׂבוֺת (dagesh forte dirimens) Prov 27:25 ; &#8212; herb, herbage , in oldest use often General (therefore including grass [ דֶּשֶׁא ]): ׳ע הַשָּׂדֶה Exod 9:22 (E), Gen 2:5 (+ שִׂיחַ ) Exod 9:25 (+ עֵץ ), 10:15 (+ id ; all J) Amos 7:2 , so ׳ע הָאָרֶץ Exod 10:12 (E), + הָעֵץ מְּרִי 10:15 (J), whence Psa 105:35 ; apparently Generally also in ׳ע הארץ Job 5:25 ; Psa 72:16 , ׳ע alone 92:8 ; ׳ע כָּלהַֿשָּׂדֶה Jer 12:14 , ׳ע alone Deut 32:2 (|| דֶּשֶׁא ), Isa 42:15 ; Psa 102:5 ; 102:12 , and Deut 29:22 ; Micah 5:6 ; Prov 19:12 ; hence ׳ע as food for cattle Deut 11:15 ; Psa 106:20 compare Jer 14:6 ; Zech 10:1 ; הָרִים עִשְּׂבוֺת Prov 27:25 (|| חָצִיר דֶּשֶׁא, ); but as human food (hence excluding דֶּשֶׁא ) ׳ע הַשָּׂדֶה Gen 3:18 (J); especially P 1:29 (+ עֶץ ), ע ׳יֶרֶק 1:30 ; 9:3 , hence ׳ע Psa 104:14 (|| חָצִיר for cattle); ׳ע distinguished from עֵץ דֶּשֶׁא, also Gen 1:11-12 , ׳ע שָׂדֶה + חָצִיר דֶּשֶׁא, 2Kin 19:26 + Isa 37:27 .","rootNote":"from an unused root meaning to glisten (or be green);","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Kgs 19 26","keyReferences":["2Kgs 19 26","Amos 7 2","Deut 11 15","Deut 29 22","Deut 32 2","Exod 9 22","Exod 9 25","Exod 10 12"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":33,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Kgs 19 26","book":"2Kgs","chapter":19,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵ֤שֶׂב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"Amos 7 2","book":"Amos","chapter":7,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵ֣שֶׂב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"Deut 11 15","book":"Deut","chapter":11,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵ֥שֶׂב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 29 22","book":"Deut","chapter":29,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵ֑שֶׂב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 32 2","book":"Deut","chapter":32,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵֽשֶׂב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 9 22","book":"Exod","chapter":9,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵ֥שֶׂב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"Exod 9 25","book":"Exod","chapter":9,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵ֤שֶׂב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"Exod 10 12","book":"Exod","chapter":10,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵ֣שֶׂב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"Exod 10 15","book":"Exod","chapter":10,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵ֣שֶׂב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"Exod 10 15","book":"Exod","chapter":10,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/בְ/עֵ֥שֶׂב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"Gen 1 11","book":"Gen","chapter":1,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵ֚שֶׂב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Gen 1 12","boo